  "limits": "Nodes are found by exact name, so a renamed node reads as missing. The extras record is read from extras.joint and compared on type, axis, pivot and limits. Pivot and axis checks need a reference export. The reference and the export are compared in their own scene roots; a change of the whole asset's root transform shows as moved pivots.",
  "related": [
    "articulation_manifest_godot_builder",
    "animation_export_trap_checker",
    "blender_godot_export_checklist"
  ],
  "technique_references": [
    "World pivot as the world matrix applied to the local pivot",
    "World axis as the world rotation applied to the local axis, compared by angle",
    "glTF 2.0 extras on nodes; Blender custom properties exported as extras",
    "Blender object origin set to geometry and object join as sources of joint loss"
  ],
